  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/KoefeXe9mcVfkdQq34/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Tinted-Campfires/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Tinted-Campfires?style=flat-square&logo=github&logoColor=white&color=364763\" alt=\"問題\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252ftinted-campfires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/tinted-campfires/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a9Y8JoY.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在尋找簡單的裝飾模組嗎？本模組為遊戲中現有的每種顏色新增了一個營火，讓您能搭配自己最喜愛的顏色來使用！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組新增的營火功能與原版遊戲中的營火完全相同。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/w0CfVsMvlA5d6v10pa/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>每個營火的合成方式都非常簡便，讓您能盡快開始使用。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media1.giphy.com/media/bPCpC21dCgTIqW1AmK/giphy.gif?cid=790b76111b486078da2a58311fdd810efa10c4be6ea2a191&rid=giphy.gif&ct=g\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>&nbsp;您也可以直接對任何營火使用染料以取得它們。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a9Y8JoY.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">**— 相容性列表 —**</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/euphoria-patches\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Patches</a></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fopjydF.png\" width=\"450\" alt=\"Euphoria Patches 預覽\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shimmer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shimmer! (pre. 1.21)</a></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ype7xhA.png\" width=\"450\" alt=\"Shimmer 預覽\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>",
